extensions:
- ublock origin
  - (maybe not this! causes captchas) settings -> filter lists -> cookie notices -> check 'EasyList/uBO — cookie notices'
  - pin to toolbar
  - gears -> My filters -> paste in anti-distraction filters:
    youtube.com
    @@music.youtube.com
    hci.social
    discord.com
    news.ycombinator.com
    reddit.com
    @@old.reddit.com
- zotero connector
  - sign into zotero.org
  - pin to toolbar
- about:addons -> allow extensions to run in private windows

Settings -> Privacy and Security:
- DNS over HTTPS -> Custom
  - Check 'Always warn me if secure DNS isn't available'
  - Choose provider: Cloudflare (default)
- Firefox Data Collection and Use -> uncheck all
- HTTPS-Only Mode -> Enable HTTPS-Only Mode in all windows
- Enhanced Tracking Protection -> Strict
- Use a Primary Password -> check
- history -> select 'use custom settings for history' -> uncheck 'remember search and form history'

Settings -> General:
- Recommend extensions as you browse -> uncheck
- Recommend features as you browse -> uncheck
- Enable link previews -> uncheck
- Open previous windows and tabs -> check
- Tabs -> Use AI to suggest tabs and a name for tab groups -> uncheck

